.TH mergecps "1" "" "The scalpel3 Checkpoint Merger" "The scalpel3 Checkpoint Merger"

.SH NAME
mergecps \- Merge scalpel3 checkpoint directories

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mergecps
\fIcheckpoint_dir1\fR
\fIcheckpoint_dir2\fR
\fIoutput_dir\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBmergecps\fR combines two scalpel3 checkpoint directories into a single
output directory.  This is used after distributed or windowed carving
(e.g., via \fBhpcscalpel3\fR(1)) to unify checkpoint state from separate
carving runs, allowing a subsequent \fBscalpel3\fR(1) invocation to
resume from the merged state.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scalpel3 (1),
.BR mergeblockmap (1),
.BR hpcscalpel3 (1)

.SH AUTHOR
Golden G. Richard III.
